packet-term - terminal UI for AX.25 connected-mode sessions over a KISS modem
https://github.com/packet-net/packet-term-tui

Copyright (c) 2026 Tom Fanning M0LTE and Packet.NET contributors

This package ships a single self-contained executable that bundles the
Packet.Term code, its .NET dependencies and the .NET runtime.

